  "hero": "<section class=\"mse-hero\"><span class=\"mse-kicker\">MEAN SQUARED ERROR · VISUAL STUDY</span><h2>How far are numerical predictions from the true values?</h2><p>Square each difference, average the squares, and inspect the cost of large mistakes. Explore worked examples, model evaluation, and gradient-based learning.</p><div class=\"mse-art\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 1000 440\" role=\"img\" aria-labelledby=\"mse-title-0 mse-desc-0\"><title id=\"mse-title-0\">How large are the prediction mistakes?</title><desc id=\"mse-desc-0\">Predictions 2,6,9 versus actuals 3,5,7 produce average squared error 2.</desc><rect width=\"1000\" height=\"440\" fill=\"#f8fcfd\"/><text x=\"38\" y=\"39\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-size=\"14\" font-family=\"system-ui,Arial,sans-serif\" font-weight=\"850\" fill=\"#278876\">MSE · VISUAL STUDY</text><text x=\"38\" y=\"79\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-size=\"25\" font-family=\"system-ui,Arial,sans-serif\" font-weight=\"850\" fill=\"#2e5368\">How large are the prediction mistakes?</text><rect x=\"34\" y=\"113\" width=\"575\" height=\"254\" rx=\"12\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#d5e5e9\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"/><text x=\"60\" y=\"153\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-size=\"16\" font-family=\"system-ui,Arial,sans-serif\" font-weight=\"840\" fill=\"#537f93\">THREE ACTUAL VALUES AND PREDICTIONS</text><text x=\"61\" y=\"195\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-size=\"17\" font-family=\"system-ui,Arial,sans-serif\" font-weight=\"760\" fill=\"#5b788c\">Case 1</text><line x1=\"165\" y1=\"189\" x2=\"540\" y2=\"189\" stroke=\"#e4edf0\" stroke-width=\"4\"/><line x1=\"273\" y1=\"189\" x2=\"237\" y2=\"189\" stroke=\"#e3a077\" stroke-width=\"7\"/><circle cx=\"273\" cy=\"189\" r=\"9\" fill=\"#41a395\"/><circle cx=\"237\" cy=\"189\" r=\"7\" fill=\"#de986a\"/><text x=\"579\" y=\"195\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-size=\"16\" font-family=\"system-ui,Arial,sans-serif\" font-weight=\"770\" fill=\"#b27954\">Δ -1</text><text x=\"61\" y=\"263\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-size=\"17\" font-family=\"system-ui,Arial,sans-serif\" font-weight=\"760\" fill=\"#5b788c\">Case 2</text><line x1=\"165\" y1=\"257\" x2=\"540\" y2=\"257\" stroke=\"#e4edf0\" stroke-width=\"4\"/><line x1=\"345\" y1=\"257\" x2=\"381\" y2=\"257\" stroke=\"#e3a077\" stroke-width=\"7\"/><circle cx=\"345\" cy=\"257\" r=\"9\" fill=\"#41a395\"/><circle cx=\"381\" cy=\"257\" r=\"7\" fill=\"#de986a\"/><text x=\"579\" y=\"263\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-size=\"16\" font-family=\"system-ui,Arial,sans-serif\" font-weight=\"770\" fill=\"#b27954\">Δ +1</text><text x=\"61\" y=\"331\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-size=\"17\" font-family=\"system-ui,Arial,sans-serif\" font-weight=\"760\" fill=\"#5b788c\">Case 3</text><line x1=\"165\" y1=\"325\" x2=\"540\" y2=\"325\" stroke=\"#e4edf0\" stroke-width=\"4\"/><line x1=\"417\" y1=\"325\" x2=\"489\" y2=\"325\" stroke=\"#e3a077\" stroke-width=\"7\"/><circle cx=\"417\" cy=\"325\" r=\"9\" fill=\"#41a395\"/><circle cx=\"489\" cy=\"325\" r=\"7\" fill=\"#de986a\"/><text x=\"579\" y=\"331\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-size=\"16\" font-family=\"system-ui,Arial,sans-serif\" font-weight=\"770\" fill=\"#b27954\">Δ +2</text><text x=\"62\" y=\"355\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-size=\"16\" font-family=\"system-ui,Arial,sans-serif\" font-weight=\"680\" fill=\"#618092\">Green = actual    Orange = predicted</text><rect x=\"625\" y=\"114\" width=\"338\" height=\"253\" rx=\"12\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#d5e5e9\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"/><text x=\"650\" y=\"154\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-size=\"17\" font-family=\"system-ui,Arial,sans-serif\" font-weight=\"850\" fill=\"#537f92\">SQUARED ERRORS</text><text x=\"650\" y=\"210\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-size=\"24\" font-family=\"system-ui,Arial,sans-serif\" font-weight=\"800\" fill=\"#4b7183\">1² + 1² + 2² = 6</text><line x1=\"652\" y1=\"229\" x2=\"923\" y2=\"229\" stroke=\"#e1e9eb\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"652\" y=\"264\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-size=\"19\" font-family=\"system-ui,Arial,sans-serif\" font-weight=\"710\" fill=\"#4d7180\">Divide by 3 examples</text><text x=\"650\" y=\"327\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-size=\"32\" font-family=\"system-ui,Arial,sans-serif\" font-weight=\"880\" fill=\"#248f81\">MSE = 2</text></svg></div><p class=\"mse-note\">Illustrative sample: actual [3, 5, 7] and predicted [2, 6, 9] produce MSE = 2 squared units.</p></section>",
