    {
      "stem": "Why does MSE square prediction errors, and how does this make the metric more sensitive to large mistakes and outliers?",
      "tag": "Beginner · Outliers",
      "answer": "d",
      "options": [
        "Squaring makes overpredictions and underpredictions contribute positive numbers, but large errors increase only in proportion to their distance. A miss of four therefore contributes twice the penalty of a miss of two.",
        "Squaring converts numerical prediction errors into percentages so they become comparable across any target units. Large unusual errors influence the result less because each is reduced by its own magnitude.",
        "Squaring removes the sign of every error and then gives all nonzero mistakes the same penalty. It prevents a small number of unusual data points from dominating overall evaluation.",
        "Squaring removes the sign of each mistake and increases the penalty more quickly for larger misses. An error of four contributes sixteen while an error of two contributes four, making MSE outlier-sensitive."
      ],
      "explanation": "<strong>Explanation:</strong> Squaring removes the sign from errors, so overpredictions and underpredictions both count. It also increases the cost of larger mistakes much faster: error 2 contributes 4, while error 4 contributes 16. This makes MSE sensitive to outliers. Imagine a warehouse model predicting package weights. Many small misses might affect MSE less than one extremely poor prediction for a heavy parcel. That can be useful when large misses matter, but it also means unusual observations deserve investigation.",
      "figure": "<section class=\"mse-figure\"><span class=\"mse-kicker\">QUESTION 02 · VISUAL LESSON</span><div class=\"mse-art\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 1000 440\" role=\"img\" aria-labelledby=\"mse-title-2 mse-desc-2\"><title id=\"mse-title-2\">Large errors grow much faster when squared</title><desc id=\"mse-desc-2\">Error two contributes four squares; error four contributes sixteen squares.</desc><rect width=\"1000\" height=\"440\" fill=\"#f8fcfd\"/><text x=\"38\" y=\"39\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-size=\"14\" font-family=\"system-ui,Arial,sans-serif\" font-weight=\"850\" fill=\"#278876\">02 · MEAN SQUARED ERROR</text><text x=\"38\" y=\"79\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-size=\"25\" font-family=\"system-ui,Arial,sans-serif\" font-weight=\"850\" fill=\"#2e5368\">Large errors grow much faster when squared</text><rect x=\"34\" y=\"114\" width=\"926\" height=\"257\" rx=\"12\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#d5e5e9\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"/><text x=\"59\" y=\"151\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-size=\"16\" font-family=\"system-ui,Arial,sans-serif\" font-weight=\"850\" fill=\"#527e92\">DOUBLE THE MISS  →  FOUR TIMES THE SQUARED COST</text><text x=\"88\" y=\"200\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-size=\"20\" font-family=\"system-ui,Arial,sans-serif\" font-weight=\"830\" fill=\"#398c92\">Error = 2</text><rect x=\"94\" y=\"222\" width=\"38\" height=\"38\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#65bdb0\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"/><rect x=\"136\" y=\"222\" width=\"38\" height=\"38\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#65bdb0\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"/><rect x=\"94\" y=\"264\" width=\"38\" height=\"38\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#65bdb0\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"/><rect x=\"136\" y=\"264\" width=\"38\" height=\"38\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#65bdb0\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"/><text x=\"91\" y=\"345\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-size=\"24\" font-family=\"system-ui,Arial,sans-serif\" font-weight=\"870\" fill=\"#298e81\">2² = 4</text><path d=\"M272 261 H355 M344 248 L355 261 L344 274\" stroke=\"#789ba9\" stroke-width=\"3\" fill=\"none\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><text x=\"382\" y=\"200\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-size=\"20\" font-family=\"system-ui,Arial,sans-serif\" font-weight=\"830\" fill=\"#bd7c53\">Error = 4</text><rect x=\"393\" y=\"220\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#e5a171\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"/><rect x=\"426\" y=\"220\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#e5a171\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"/><rect x=\"459\" y=\"220\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#e5a171\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"/><rect x=\"492\" y=\"220\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#e5a171\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"/><rect x=\"393\" y=\"253\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#e5a171\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"/><rect x=\"426\" y=\"253\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#e5a171\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"/><rect x=\"459\" y=\"253\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#e5a171\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"/><rect x=\"492\" y=\"253\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#e5a171\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"/><rect x=\"393\" y=\"286\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#e5a171\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"/><rect x=\"426\" y=\"286\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#e5a171\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"/><rect x=\"459\" y=\"286\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#e5a171\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"/><rect x=\"492\" y=\"286\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#e5a171\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"/><rect x=\"393\" y=\"319\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#e5a171\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"/><rect x=\"426\" y=\"319\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#e5a171\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"/><rect x=\"459\" y=\"319\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#e5a171\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"/><rect x=\"492\" y=\"319\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#e5a171\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"/><text x=\"558\" y=\"353\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-size=\"24\" font-family=\"system-ui,Arial,sans-serif\" font-weight=\"860\" fill=\"#b47c55\">4² = 16</text><rect x=\"702\" y=\"185\" width=\"219\" height=\"140\" rx=\"12\" fill=\"#f2faf9\" stroke=\"#d5e5e9\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"/><text x=\"813\" y=\"223\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"22\" font-family=\"system-ui,Arial,sans-serif\" font-weight=\"820\" fill=\"#3f7083\">One outlier</text><text x=\"813\" y=\"264\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"20\" font-family=\"system-ui,Arial,sans-serif\" font-weight=\"690\" fill=\"#4c7180\">may dominate</text><text x=\"813\" y=\"293\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"19\" font-family=\"system-ui,Arial,sans-serif\" font-weight=\"690\" fill=\"#4c7180\">the average</text></svg></div><p class=\"mse-note\">Doubling the prediction miss quadruples its squared penalty.</p></section>"
    },
    {
      "stem": "How is MSE calculated step by step for actual values [3, 5, 7] and predictions [2, 6, 9], including errors, squared errors, and the final average?",
      "tag": "Beginner · Calculation",
      "answer": "a",
      "options": [
        "Subtract actual from predicted: errors are [−1, 1, 2]. Square them to get [1, 1, 4], add to obtain 6, then divide by three examples. MSE equals 2.",
        "Subtract actual from predicted: errors are [−1, 1, 2]. Take absolute values [1, 1, 2], add to obtain 4, then divide by three examples. MSE equals approximately 1.33.",
        "Subtract actual from predicted: errors are [−1, 1, 2]. Add the signed values to obtain 2, divide by three and square the average. MSE equals approximately 0.44.",
        "Subtract actual from predicted: errors are [−1, 1, 2]. Square and average them to obtain 2, then take the square root as a final step. MSE equals approximately 1.41."
      ],
      "explanation": "<strong>Explanation:</strong> Subtract actual values from predictions: 2−3=−1, 6−5=1, and 9−7=2. Squaring gives 1, 1, and 4. Add them to get 6, then divide by three examples. The MSE is 2. If the values were river water levels in meters, the MSE would have units of square meters. Taking another square root would produce RMSE, which is a different metric.",
      "figure": "<section class=\"mse-figure\"><span class=\"mse-kicker\">QUESTION 03 · VISUAL LESSON</span><div class=\"mse-art\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 1000 440\" role=\"img\" aria-labelledby=\"mse-title-3 mse-desc-3\"><title id=\"mse-title-3\">Calculate every term step by step</title><desc id=\"mse-desc-3\">Actual values 3 5 7 and predicted values 2 6 9 yield squared errors 1 1 4 and final MSE 2.</desc><rect width=\"1000\" height=\"440\" fill=\"#f8fcfd\"/><text x=\"38\" y=\"39\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-size=\"14\" font-family=\"system-ui,Arial,sans-serif\" font-weight=\"850\" fill=\"#278876\">03 · MEAN SQUARED ERROR</text><text x=\"38\" y=\"79\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-size=\"25\" font-family=\"system-ui,Arial,sans-serif\" font-weight=\"850\" fill=\"#2e5368\">Calculate every term step by step</text><rect x=\"35\" y=\"110\" width=\"925\" height=\"268\" rx=\"12\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#d5e5e9\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"/><text x=\"64\" y=\"148\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-size=\"18\" font-family=\"system-ui,Arial,sans-serif\" font-weight=\"850\" fill=\"#507f94\">ACTUAL</text><text x=\"278\" y=\"148\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-size=\"18\" font-family=\"system-ui,Arial,sans-serif\" font-weight=\"850\" fill=\"#507f94\">PREDICT</text><text x=\"492\" y=\"148\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-size=\"18\" font-family=\"system-ui,Arial,sans-serif\" font-weight=\"850\" fill=\"#507f94\">ERROR</text><text x=\"706\" y=\"148\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-size=\"18\" font-family=\"system-ui,Arial,sans-serif\" font-weight=\"850\" fill=\"#507f94\">ERROR²</text><text x=\"64\" y=\"203\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-size=\"22\" font-family=\"system-ui,Arial,sans-serif\" font-weight=\"780\" fill=\"#3c6a7c\">3</text><text x=\"278\" y=\"203\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-size=\"22\" font-family=\"system-ui,Arial,sans-serif\" font-weight=\"780\" fill=\"#3c6a7c\">2</text><text x=\"492\" y=\"203\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-size=\"22\" font-family=\"system-ui,Arial,sans-serif\" font-weight=\"780\" fill=\"#3c6a7c\">-1</text><text x=\"706\" y=\"203\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-size=\"22\" font-family=\"system-ui,Arial,sans-serif\" font-weight=\"780\" fill=\"#258d80\">1</text><text x=\"64\" y=\"254\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-size=\"22\" font-family=\"system-ui,Arial,sans-serif\" font-weight=\"780\" fill=\"#3c6a7c\">5</text><text x=\"278\" y=\"254\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-size=\"22\" font-family=\"system-ui,Arial,sans-serif\" font-weight=\"780\" fill=\"#3c6a7c\">6</text><text x=\"492\" y=\"254\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-size=\"22\" font-family=\"system-ui,Arial,sans-serif\" font-weight=\"780\" fill=\"#3c6a7c\">+1</text><text x=\"706\" y=\"254\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-size=\"22\" font-family=\"system-ui,Arial,sans-serif\" font-weight=\"780\" fill=\"#258d80\">1</text><text x=\"64\" y=\"305\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-size=\"22\" font-family=\"system-ui,Arial,sans-serif\" font-weight=\"780\" fill=\"#3c6a7c\">7</text><text x=\"278\" y=\"305\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-size=\"22\" font-family=\"system-ui,Arial,sans-serif\" font-weight=\"780\" fill=\"#3c6a7c\">9</text><text x=\"492\" y=\"305\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-size=\"22\" font-family=\"system-ui,Arial,sans-serif\" font-weight=\"780\" fill=\"#3c6a7c\">+2</text><text x=\"706\" y=\"305\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-size=\"22\" font-family=\"system-ui,Arial,sans-serif\" font-weight=\"780\" fill=\"#258d80\">4</text><line x1=\"52\" y1=\"164\" x2=\"934\" y2=\"164\" stroke=\"#dce8ed\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"52\" y1=\"216\" x2=\"934\" y2=\"216\" stroke=\"#dce8ed\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"52\" y1=\"268\" x2=\"934\" y2=\"268\" stroke=\"#dce8ed\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"257\" y1=\"126\" x2=\"257\" y2=\"303\" stroke=\"#dce8ed\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"471\" y1=\"126\" x2=\"471\" y2=\"303\" stroke=\"#dce8ed\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"685\" y1=\"126\" x2=\"685\" y2=\"303\" stroke=\"#dce8ed\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"62\" y=\"354\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-size=\"22\" font-family=\"system-ui,Arial,sans-serif\" font-weight=\"770\" fill=\"#4a7082\">SUM:  1 + 1 + 4 = 6</text><text x=\"596\" y=\"354\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-size=\"26\" font-family=\"system-ui,Arial,sans-serif\" font-weight=\"850\" fill=\"#238b7e\">MSE = 6 / 3 = 2</text></svg></div><p class=\"mse-note\">The squared-error mean is 2; taking a square root would give RMSE.</p></section>"
